# Token & models

## Context hygiene
- Do not load whole apps; open the few files you edit.
- Do not dump MCP schemas into answers; call tools only when needed.
- Keep answers short unless user asks for depth.
- Prefer project skills/rules over re-explaining stack each turn.

## Model routing (user picks in Cursor model picker)
| Task | Prefer |
|------|--------|
| Rename, typo, explain 1 file, draft text | Ollama local (cheap/free) |
| Small UI/API edit 1–3 files | Composer / Auto Cost–Balance |
| Payments, auth, migrations, security, multi-file architecture | Frontier (Claude/GPT) — never Ollama alone |

